{"id": "section-body-15307", "title": "Visual Problems", "chapterId": "chapter-fourteen", "blocks": [{"id": "body-15307", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Visual Problems", "runs": [{"text": "Visual"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Problems"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1271"}}, {"id": "body-15308", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Visual problems may be due to refractive errors, damage to the eye or optic nerve. This may be an indication of underlying diseases such as diabetes or hypertension.", "runs": [{"text": "Visual problems may be due to refractive errors, damage to the eye or optic nerve. This may be an indication of underlying"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "diseases such as diabetes or hypertension."}]}, {"id": "body-15311", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Investigations", "runs": [{"text": "Investigations"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-15312", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Assess ocular alignment", "runs": [{"text": "Assess"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ocular"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "alignment"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1227"}}, {"id": "body-15313", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Determine visual acuity accurately in both eyes by Snellen chart", "runs": [{"text": "Determine visual acuity accurately in both eyes by Snellen chart"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1227"}}, {"id": "body-15314", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "If vision is diminished, (less than 6/12), perform the following: -", "runs": [{"text": "If vision is diminished, (less than 6/12), perform the following: -"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1227"}}, {"id": "body-15315", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Pin hole test", "runs": [{"text": "Pin"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "hole"}, {"text": " test"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1227"}}, {"id": "body-15316", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Make a hole of about 1mm wide in a piece of dark/black paper – you can push a hole in a paper or card with a pen tip", "runs": [{"text": "Make a hole of about 1mm wide in a piece of dark/black paper – you can push a hole in a paper or card with a pen tip"}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1227"}}, {"id": "body-15317", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Ask the patient to look through this hole at the Snellen chart", "runs": [{"text": "Ask the patient to look through this hole at the Snellen chart"}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1227"}}, {"id": "body-15318", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "If vision improves, this means that the patient has a refractive error", "runs": [{"text": "If vision improves, this means that the patient has a refractive error"}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1227"}}, {"id": "body-15321", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Red Reflex Test", "runs": [{"text": "Red"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Reflex"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Test"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1226"}}, {"id": "body-15322", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "The patient looks past the examiners head focusing on a distant target.", "runs": [{"text": "The patient looks past the examiners head focusing on a distant target."}]}, {"id": "body-15323", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "\tWith the ophthalmoscope at 0 (zero) the examiner keeps close to his eye and then focuses the beam of light so that it falls on the pupillary area of the cornea", "runs": [{"text": "\t"}, {"text": "With the ophthalmoscope at 0 (zero) the examiner keeps close to his eye and then focuses"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "beam"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "light"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "so"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "that"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "it"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "falls"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the pupillary area of the cornea"}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1226"}}, {"id": "body-15324", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "The examiner stands about 60cm away from the patient.", "runs": [{"text": "The examiner stands about 60cm away from the patient."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1226"}}, {"id": "body-15325", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "In normal individuals, the examiner should be able to see a red or pink colour (reflex) through the pupil which comes from the retina.", "runs": [{"text": "In normal individuals, the examiner should be able"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "see"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "red"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pink"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "colour"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(reflex)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "through the pupil which comes"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "from the retina."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1226"}}, {"id": "body-15328", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Significance of absent red reflex", "runs": [{"text": "Significance"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "absent"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "red"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "reflex"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-15329", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "If there is history of trauma or diabetes, the absence of a red reflex is probably due to:", "runs": [{"text": "If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "there"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "history"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "trauma"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "diabetes,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "absence"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "red"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "reflex"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "probably"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "due"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to:"}]}, {"id": "body-15330", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Retinal detachment", "runs": [{"text": "Retinal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "detachment"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1225"}}, {"id": "body-15331", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "A vitreous hemorrhage", "runs": [{"text": "A"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "vitreous"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "hemorrhage"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1225"}}, {"id": "body-15332", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Mature cataract", "runs": [{"text": "Mature"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cataract"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1225"}}, {"id": "body-15334", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "If there are cataracts, one usually sees:", "runs": [{"text": "If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "there"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cataracts,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "one"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "usually"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sees:"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-15335", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Black shadows against the red reflex in immature cataract, or", "runs": [{"text": "Black"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "shadows"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "against"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "red"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "reflex"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "immature"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cataract,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1225"}}, {"id": "body-15336", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Absence of red reflex in mature cataracts", "runs": [{"text": "Absence"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "red"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "reflex"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mature"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cataracts"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1225"}}, {"id": "body-15338", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "In a >50years of age with no history of trauma, diabetes or previous eye disease, an absent red reflex is often due to cataract formation, especially with decreased visual acuity.", "runs": [{"text": "In a >50years of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "age with no"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "history of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "trauma,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "diabetes or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "previous eye disease,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "an absent"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "red reflex is often due to cataract formation, especially with decreased visual acuity."}]}, {"id": "body-15339-textbox1-00001", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Note: Associated diabetes or hypertension should be adequately managed with referral, as surgery can only be considered with appropriately managed systemic disease", "runs": [{"text": "Note: ", "bold": true}, {"text": "Associated diabetes or hypertension should be adequately managed with referral, as surgery can only be considered with appropriately managed systemic disease"}]}, {"id": "body-15341", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Normal", "text": "Table 14.7: Referral Criteria for Eye Conditions", "runs": [{"text": "Table", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "14.7:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "Referral", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "Criteria", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "for", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "Eye", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "Conditions", "bold": true}]}, {"id": "body-15342", "type": "table", "rows": [{"cells": [{"blocks": [{"id": "body-15342-r1-c1-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "Category", "runs": [{"text": "Category", "bold": true}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowsp